# The reference system had a writer on four producers and a reader on one terminal.
# Everything patch6, patch7 and patch8 checked asked whether the mark was WRITTEN,
# so nothing noticed that the Proxy terminal printed it as text, or that one painter
# served three feeds and named every landing place as though it were the Thinking
# one. Neither throws. Both are only visible by looking at what a painter PRODUCED,
# which is what gate-tools/ref-check.js does.
