# ---------------------------------------------------------- v3.76 patch180
# THE PROXY IS A PROXY. The owner reverted to the official 3.76 and his speech
# and combat came back. Between that build and the patches, on the wire: every
# content delta of every reasoning-off provider rebuilt without its id, object,
# created, model and finish_reason (p149); the leading-thought reorder grown from
# Dialogue to Combat; non-stream bodies re-serialised; and the socket held open
# until the panel's own record-keeping finished. And a handler that failed
# vanished without a line. None of those is what a proxy does. Now the wire is
# verbatim unless a reader turns a named rewrite on, the record is written
# after the close, and nothing dies in silence.
